                "description": "ABANDONED PROJECT (I guess?)\r\n\r\n\r\nHello everyone, I know it has been a long while since any communication about this mod - and I apologize for that. I little bit of burnout this, a little bit of new job that... You get it (Or may not, and that's okay too!). \r\n\r\nI will not be attempting to make this mod work for 1.0 at the moment, and I can/will not give someone the repository so easily. The real issue here: The art is not mine, it is drawn by Mr... butthole. Even if you get his permission, the code is absolutely worthless now. This mod was made possible through the extensive use of hacks and workarounds that probably do not work anymore. It would be more challenging disassembling what I have done and updating it than it would be making something completely new. \r\n\r\nAt the end of this, I am just not interested in modding/playing Necesse anymore. Regardless of my wishes, my joy for it never came back after the burnout. \r\n\r\nTake care of yourselves and please pay attention to when you think that you are overextending yourself - or you might find yourself reaching out less. ",
